  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:350px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-crimson pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absorption Magic</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/51/Nanatsu_no_Taizai_Ban_Snatch_Physical_Hunt.gif/revision/latest?cb=20220412024638\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Nanatsu no Taizai Ban Snatch Physical Hunt\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/51/Nanatsu_no_Taizai_Ban_Snatch_Physical_Hunt.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20220412024638\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/51/Nanatsu_no_Taizai_Ban_Snatch_Physical_Hunt.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20220412024638 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/5/51/Nanatsu_no_Taizai_Ban_Snatch_Physical_Hunt.gif/revision/latest?cb=20220412024638 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Nanatsu no Taizai Ban Snatch Physical Hunt\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Nanatsu_no_Taizai_Ban_Snatch_Physical_Hunt.gif\" data-image-name=\"Nanatsu no Taizai Ban Snatch Physical Hunt.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Ban (Nanatsu no Taizai/The Seven Deadly Sins) uses magical techniques from his Snatch power to absorb/drain opponents' strength, speed and/or physical power.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Use absorption magic.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>use absorption-based magic</b>. Form of <a href=\"/wiki/Magic\" title=\"Magic\">Magic</a>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Absorption Energy Manipulation\">Absorption Energy Manipulation</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Magical Energy Absorption\">Magical Energy Absorption</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Absorption\" title=\"Spell Absorption\">Spell Absorption</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Anime/Manga/Manhwa\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Anime/Manga/Manhwa</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Magic%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absorption Commands</li>\n<li>Absorption Witchcraft/Wizardry</li>\n<li>Assimilation/Drainage/Leeching/Swallowing Magic/Witchcraft/Wizardry</li>\n<li>Siphoner Magic</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Magic%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user is capable of wielding magic related to absorption, assimilation and/or leeching. They utilize magical abilities or cast spells that allow them to drain or feed off of the targeted material or power (physical properties, energy, elements, organic substances, etc.).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Magic%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absolute_Absorption\" title=\"Absolute Absorption\">Absolute Absorption</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Energy_Manipulation\" title=\"Absorption Energy Manipulation\">Absorption Energy Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Casting\" title=\"Spell Casting\">Spell Casting</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Arts\" title=\"Absorption Arts\">Absorption Arts</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Magic%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Affinity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Affinity\">Affinity</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Parasitic_Empowerment\" title=\"Parasitic Empowerment\">Parasitic Empowerment</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Magic\" title=\"Magic\">Magic</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Magic%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Anti_Storage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Anti Storage\">Anti Storage</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Anti-Magic\" title=\"Anti-Magic\">Anti-Magic</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Destruction\" title=\"Magic Destruction\">Magic Destruction</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Negation\" title=\"Magic Negation\">Magic Negation</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Sealing\" title=\"Magic Sealing\">Magic Sealing</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Magical_Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Magical Energy Absorption\">Magical Energy Absorption</a></li>\n<li>Magic may have a price.</li>\n<li>Magic may only work on specific material or energy being targeted for absorption.</li>\n<li>Strength of spells could be dependent on strength of magic.</li>\n<li>Control, discipline, and restraint are extremely important. Unconscious, emotion-influenced, impulsive, or reckless use of this power can be catastrophic.</li>\n<li>Without the knowledge or proper skill, the intended use of such magic can create unpredictable or potentially dangerous results.</li>\n<li>Effects may be temporary.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Magic%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://blackclover.fandom.com/wiki/Yami_Sukehiro\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blackclover:Yami Sukehiro\">Yami Sukehiro</a> (<i>Black Clover</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blackclover.fandom.com/wiki/Catherine\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blackclover:Catherine\">Catherine</a> (<i>Black Clover</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://blackclover.fandom.com/wiki/Zagred\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:blackclover:Zagred\">Zagred</a> (<i>Black Clover</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Erzsebet_B%C3%A1thory\">Erzsebet Bathory</a> (<i>Castlevania Nocturne</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fairytail.fandom.com/wiki/Fukuro\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:fairytail:Fukuro\">Fukuro</a> (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fairytail.fandom.com/wiki/Vidaldus_Taka\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:fairytail:Vidaldus Taka\">Vidaldus Taka</a> (<i>Fairy Tail</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://fairytail.fandom.com/wiki/Touka\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:fairytail:Touka\">Touka/White Wizard</a> (<i>Fairy Tail: 100 Years Quest</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://finalfantasy.fandom.com/wiki/Absorb_Stat\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:finalfantasy:Absorb Stat\">Absorb Stat</a> Users (<i>Final Fantasy series</i>)</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://marvelcinematicuniverse.fandom.com/wiki/Agatha_Harkness\">Agatha Harkness</a> (<i>Marvel Cinematic Universe</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvelcinematicuniverse.fandom.com/wiki/Doctor_Strange/Corrupted_Doctor_Strange\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvelcinematicuniverse:Doctor Strange/Corrupted Doctor Strange\">Dark Sorcerer Doctor Strange</a> (<i>Marvel Cinematic Universe</i>/<i>What If...?</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nanatsu-no-taizai.fandom.com/wiki/Ban\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:nanatsu-no-taizai:Ban\">Ban</a> (<i>/Nanatsu no Taizai/The Seven Deadly Sins</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://theowlhouse.fandom.com/wiki/Emperor_Belos\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:theowlhouse:Emperor Belos\">Philip Wittebane/Emperor Belos</a> (<i>The Owl House</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://starvstheforcesofevil.fandom.com/wiki/Wyscan_the_Granter_(character)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:starvstheforcesofevil:Wyscan the Granter (character)\">Wyscan the Granter</a> (<i>Star vs the Forces of Evil</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Magic%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span id=\"Anime.2FManga.2FManhwa\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Anime/Manga/Manhwa\">Anime/Manga/Manhwa</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorption_Magic%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"4fbce38de5ccffcdbe68ca9e7be534e1\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Yami_Sukehiro-s_Dark_Magic_-_Black_Hole-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:8